# names below. They are NOT RDF declarations in commons#; the actual shapes are
# the ecg:* resources above under https://id.exergism.org/governance#.
# This mirrors the explicit transition markers in ontology/commons.ttl and can
# be removed once the core validator itself is migrated to the governance
# namespace without changing any published semantic identifier.
